opentide deploy --platform sentinel --dry-run
```

## Object layout

- `Objects/Threat Vectors/` — threat vectors
- `Objects/Detection Objectives/` — detection objectives
- `Objects/Detection Rules/` — MDR rules
- `Configurations/` — platform and visibility configuration
- `Schemas/` — generated JSON schemas and templates (via `opentide generate`)

